      "title": "THE PROBLEMATIC OF INTERPRETING RELIGIOUS TEXTS IN THE PHILOSOPHY OF J\u00dcRGEN HABERMAS AND ITS REPRESENTATIONS IN THE PUBLIC SPHERE",
      "authors": [
